OL,3,GNEWSAFlynn was emailed over ferry gas
OL,4,Aleak before he denied knowing about it
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Secretary Stephen Flynn told
OL,7,Fa Holyrood committee he knew nothing
OL,8,Fabout a gas leak on board a CalMac
OL,9,Fferry, despite records showing he had
OL,10,Fbeen emailed about the incident.
OL,12,FA faulty valve led to 700kg of methane
OL,13,Fgas being vented from the side of MV
OL,14,FGlen Sannox while it was carrying
OL,15,Fpassengers from Arran to Troon in June
OL,16,F2025.
OL,18,FFlynn claimed he missed a BBC Scotland
OL,19,Freport on the incident as he was
OL,20,Ffacetiming his children before he
OL,21,Fappeared in front of the transport
OL,22,Fcommittee last month.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
