OL,3,GNEWSAFlynn was emailed over ferry gas
OL,4,Aleak before he denied knowing about it
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a briefing document released via a
OL,7,Ffreedom of information (FOI) request
OL,8,Fshowed Flynn was contacted about the
OL,9,Fstory twice in the hours between
OL,10,Fpublication and his committee
OL,11,Fappearance.
